# Agatha's Soul Cauldron: "Creatures you control with +1/+1 counters on them have all activated abilities of all
# creature cards exiled with" it - the activated ones only. Haywire Mite has a dies trigger and "{G}, Sacrifice this
# creature: Exile target noncreature artifact". Faithless Looting discards it on turn 3; the Cauldron exiles it and puts
# a counter on Ornithopter, which can now pay {G} (Mox Emerald) and sacrifice itself to exile Mox Emerald. Ornithopter
# dies without gaining Bot1 2 life: the Mite's triggered ability is not among the abilities it was given (CR 113.1).

